WEBVTT

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:00.261
SW: Yeah. It can get a bird 
like Einstein frustrated.

00:02:00.261 --> 00:02:01.000
E: [Squawks]

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.460
SW: Yeah, it sure can.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:05.507
But when Einstein needs to relax 
from her job educating the public

00:02:05.507 --> 00:02:07.000
she loves to take in the arts.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.640
If the children of the Uganda 
need another dance partner,

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:13.850
Einstein could sure fit the bill, 
because she loves to dance.

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:15.000
Can you get down?

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.000
E: [Bobbing head] (Laughter)

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.470
SW: Let's get down for everybody. 
Come on now.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.000
She's going to make me 
do it, too. Ooh, ooh.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.000
Einstein: Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.000
SW: Do your head now.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:25.873
E: Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.000
(Laughter)

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.860
SW: Or maybe Sirena Huang would like 
to learn some arias on her violin,